---
description: Security requirements that apply from Sprint 01
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never implement fake authentication or mock sessions.
- Identity does not imply tenant access.
- Never commit secrets. Use `.env.example` with empty or local-dev-only values.
- Never trust tenant ID from a JSON body. Tenant comes from verified membership and route slug checks.
- Default deny for authorization.
- Platform administrators must not receive automatic access to tenant business data.
- Do not expose an unrestricted Prisma client from route handlers.
- Tenant database context uses `SET LOCAL app.tenant_id` inside a transaction, never session-level SET on pooled connections.
- Domain packages must not depend on React.
